COURSE BASE REGULAR 1 CORE
COURSE SUB SU 0 MANDATORY_SU
COURSE SELF REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=SELF
COURSE MISSING REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=NOPE
COURSE DUP REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE,BASE
COURSE BADMIN REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE:S
COURSE SUBMIN REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=SUB:A
COURSE COLON REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE:
COURSE EMPTY REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=,BASE
COURSE DOUBLE REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE,,SUB
COURSE MULTICOLON REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE:A:B
COURSE OK REGULAR 1 OPEN PRE=BASE:D
COURSE BADTYPE UNKNOWN 1 OPEN
COURSE BADCATEGORY REGULAR 1 SOMETHING
COURSE BADNUMBER REGULAR nope OPEN
COURSE TOOBIG REGULAR 25 OPEN
COURSE NEGATIVE REGULAR -1 OPEN
